<title>JAPAN: Japan 1997/98 reactor closures to peak in Q1, Q3.</title>
<headline>Japan 1997/98 reactor closures to peak in Q1, Q3.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regular maintenance shutdowns at Japan's nuclear power plants are to peak in the first and third quarters of fiscal 1997/98, which started on Tuesday, electric power companies said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of each reactor's shutdown schedule are as follows:</p>
<p>			   -REACTOR  CAPACITY-    -DATE-</p>
<p>				  (1,000 KW)</p>
